    // マッチング: rounds of 5 pairs; tap a word, then its meaning
    // マッチング settings (remembered): what the right side shows, pairs per round, and how many rounds (0 = all)
    // ---------- time attack (マッチング・神経衰弱) ----------
    // words keep coming from a reshuffled pool; nothing repeats inside one round
